Package: scd
Version: 1.0.0
Section: security
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SCD Team <scd@example.com>
Description: Suspicious Command Detector — CLI security utility
 SCD is a lightweight, zero-dependency CLI security tool written in C
 that scans shell command history for dangerous or suspicious patterns
 and produces structured alerts.
 .
 Features include: 10+ threat categories, POSIX regex rules, webhook
 alerts (generic + Slack), web dashboard, daemon mode with inotify,
 user behavior baselining, and Docker support.
Homepage: https://github.com/Aryansin1234/Suspicious-Command-Detector
